|GKOMYTHIC GUILDS

|WKOMythic guilds are more powerful guilds that can only be joined
at mythic character creation. A mythic character is a multicharacter
attained by either reaching LEGEND (lvl 65) with your primary character,
reaching HERO (lvl 45) with both your primary and secondary characters,
or by buying the mythic character slot for 20MIL in gold. Please see
|YKBhelp multichars |WKOfor more information on the multichar system.

